# Cloudflare Pages redirects (SPEC.md §10.4). Legacy WordPress URLs → static equivalents.
# Note: `_redirects` cannot match query strings, so the WordPress `/?p=ID` form cannot be handled here.
# Old `/?p=ID` links simply land on the home page, which is acceptable (see README "Redirects").
/wp-content/uploads/*   /uploads/:splat            301
/author/*               /news/                     301
/category/*             /news/                     301
/feed                   /news/                     301
/feed/*                 /news/                     301
/wp-json/*              /                          301
/wp-admin/*             /                          302
/wp-login.php           /                          302
/web-agency-gb-home/    /                          301
